{ [%eval -0.11] Black recaptures with the queen. } 6. Nc3
{ [%eval -0.19] White develops a piece and prepares Be3 or Nb5, which would hit the queen. }
6... Nf6 { [%eval 0.11] Black develops. } 7. d3 $10
{ [%eval 0.20] The pawn on d3 defends c4, and the c1 bishop is free to come to e3 with tempo against the queen. }
