Bd6 $10 { [%eval 0.29] Black develops with pressure on the kingside. } ) 3. g3
{ [%eval 0.21] White plans a fianchetto, with the bishop on g2 aimed at d5 and the queenside. It resembles a Catalan with the knight on f3 and no pawn on d4 yet. White can play d4 later and transpose to a closed Catalan. }
3... Nf6 { [%eval 0.34] Black develops. } 4. Bg2
{ [%eval 0.21] The bishop takes the long diagonal. } 4... Be7
